{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17472","headline":"秋闺月 · 权德舆","name":"秋闺月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三五二八月如练，海上天涯应共见。\n不知何处玉楼前，乍入深闺玳瑁筵。\n露浓香迳和愁坐，风动罗帏照独眠。\n初卷珠帘看不足，斜抱箜篌未成曲。\n稍映妆台临绮窗，遥知不语泪双双。\n此时愁望知何极，万里秋天同一色。\n霭霭遥分陌上光，迢迢对此闺中忆。\n早晚归来欢讌同，可怜歌吹月明中。\n此夜不堪肠断绝，愿随流影到辽东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}